THM3880_IDENTITY A^2Delta=27(P^3-u^2);P=1+(2/3)AC
THM3880_MARKED_ROOT z^2=P;carrier forces one global sign u=epsilon*z^3
THM3880_PLUS A^2B+=(z-1)^2(2z+1)/2
THM3880_MINUS A^2B-=-(z+1)^2(2z-1)/2
THM3880_JUMP B_epsilon(-z)-B_epsilon(z)=-2epsilon*z^3/A^2 when A!=0
THM3880_A0 use u equality;opposite z=+/-1 still impossible
THM3880_Z0 silent genuine boundary;2AC+3=0,b=2C^2/9 is positive
THM3880_NODE_IFF regular B descends at a node iff root signs are not opposite nonzero
THM3880_A2 same-sign forced B automatically has zero cusp derivative
THM3880_GLOBAL_IFF for ordinary-node/A2 curves,regular extension descends iff no opposite node
THM3880_OPEN regular-extension pole gate and higher singularity jets remain open
THM3880_THM3876 eta collision is exactly z->-z and recovers its jump
